# Backend standards

## Module boundaries

- **bff-gateway**: OAuth2 session, user directory, admin user CRUD, gateway proxy to storage
- **storage-service**: files, shares, Flyway migrations — no Keycloak user management

## Java / Spring

- Constructor injection; `@Service` / `@RestController` / `@Configuration`
- DTOs in `model/dto` (storage) or `model/` (gateway); entities in `model/entity`
- Throw `ApiException` with error code + French message; handled by `GlobalExceptionHandler`
- `@Transactional` on services; `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` for queries
- `@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')")` on admin endpoints

## Security

- Gateway: WebFlux security, CSRF disabled (API + OAuth), CORS from `CorsProperties`
- Storage: JWT resource server, stateless sessions, method security enabled

## Persistence

- Schema changes only via Flyway in `storage-service/src/main/resources/db/migration/`
- Use JPA repositories; avoid native SQL unless necessary

## Naming

- Package: `com.nextu.fileshare.{gateway|storage}`
- REST paths: `/api/files`, `/api/admin/users`, `/api/me`, `/api/users`
